      "params": [],
      "pos": [
        50,
        0
      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "Two sine oscillators a fifth apart draw a Lissajous figure on the Scope Trace.\nA slow LFO detunes the second oscillator a little, so the figure keeps turning inside out.\nA second LFO swells the beam dwell, and a slow saw turns the whole picture.\nTry the Scope Trace knobs: DECAY, BEAM, BLOOM and HUE.\nTry the frequency knob on the first oscillator. A whole number ratio like 3 to 2 makes a still figure.\nThe oscillators also play quietly through the audio output."
      }
    },
